flowchart TD
    User([End User<br>Browser])
    subgraph Tier_1 [Presentation Layer]
        Browser[Browser]
        HTML_CSS[HTML / CSS]
        JS_FW[JavaScript / jQuery]
        CSS_FW[Bootstrap Framework]
    end

    subgraph Tier_2 [Application Layer]
        WebServer[Web Server<br>Apache / Nginx]
        PHP[PHP Interpreter]
        subgraph PHP_Modules [Core Modules]
            Auth[Auth]
            ContactsMgmt[Contacts]
            LeadsMgmt[Leads]
            TasksMgmt[Tasks]
            Reports[Reports]
        end
        PHP_Composer[Composer<br>Package Manager]
        Libs[Libraries<br>PHPMailer, etc.]
    end

    subgraph Tier_3 [Data Layer]
        DBServer[Database Server<br>MySQL]
        DBSchema[Database Schema<br>Users, Contacts,...]
    end

    User --> Browser
    Browser -->|HTTPS / Web Requests| WebServer
    WebServer -->|PHP Processing| PHP
    PHP --- PHP_Modules
    PHP --- PHP_Composer
    PHP_Composer --- Libs
    PHP -->|SQL Queries| DBServer
    DBServer --> DBSchema
    DBSchema -->|Result Sets| PHP
    PHP -->|Rendered HTML/JSON| WebServer
    WebServer -->|HTTP Response| Browser